WEBVTT

00:14:27.197 --> 00:14:30.294
in part because, as we talked about,
they're more likely to smoke,

00:14:30.318 --> 00:14:32.703
overeat, drink too much,
work too hard, and so on.

00:14:32.727 --> 00:14:35.657
But also, through mechanisms
that we don't fully understand,

00:14:35.681 --> 00:14:38.166
people who are lonely
and depressed are many times --

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.287
three to five to ten times
in some studies --

00:14:40.311 --> 00:14:42.367
more likely to get sick
and die prematurely.

00:14:42.391 --> 00:14:45.399
And depression is treatable.
We need to do something about that.

00:14:45.423 --> 00:14:48.568
Now on the other hand, anything
that promotes intimacy is healing.

00:14:48.592 --> 00:14:49.935
It can be sexual intimacy --

00:14:49.959 --> 00:14:52.339
I happen to think healing energy
and erotic energy

00:14:52.363 --> 00:14:54.642
are just different forms
of the same thing.

00:14:54.666 --> 00:14:57.500
Friendship, altruism,
compassion, service --

00:14:57.524 --> 00:14:59.624
all the perennial truths
that we talked about

00:14:59.648 --> 00:15:01.845
that are part of all religion
and all cultures,